    "reason": "Strict post-T structural continuation is not worse in DEEP/VERY_DEEP than in NORMAL_OR_SHALLOW (65.2% vs 80.3% / 89.9%). In the fixed 81-event Fib-near sample, 64/81 still reached Fib1.272 before structural invalidation, including 55 VERY_DEEP events, while headroom was below 5% by construction. This supports prioritizing a separate early-entry causal study over deleting deep Wave2 contexts. At the same time, existing T-day gates already exclude all 217 VERY_DEEP events from ENTRY_ALLOWED in this development funnel, so a new depth gate would be redundant here; no production change is authorized by this result.",
